   "index": "b05",
   "text": "Covers: labels, property types, NOT NULL (sh:minCount at least 1, list or scalar), lists, relationship endpoints.\nLeaves out: counts on relationships, sh:in, sh:pattern, ranges, lengths (no GRAPH TYPE form).\nCoverage depends on sh:targetClass shapes: shapes targeted by node or SPARQL give no element type.\nIt adds a guard for later writes; the n10s gate (V6-V12) stays the proof.",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "27zjwoctb3utu5j4",
   "originalText": "Covers: labels, property types, NOT NULL (sh:minCount at least 1, list or scalar), lists, relationship endpoints.\nLeaves out: counts on relationships, sh:in, sh:pattern, ranges, lengths (no GRAPH TYPE form).\nCoverage depends on sh:targetClass shapes: shapes targeted by node or SPARQL give no element type.\nIt adds a guard for later writes; the n10s gate (V6-V12) stays the proof.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  }
